# G4-P0 binding-only candidate derived from the frozen G3 provider configuration.
# Enable OF platform population, PMUGRF syscon/regmap and the RK3568 IO-domain driver.
# The matching DTB has all nine IO-domain *-supply properties removed.
# Expected effect: child enumeration, driver bind and PMUGRF syscon regmap acquisition only.
# No regulator voltage reads, notifier registration or selector register transactions.
CONFIG_MFD_SYSCON=y
CONFIG_REGMAP=y
CONFIG_REGMAP_MMIO=y
CONFIG_ROCKCHIP_IODOMAIN=y
